{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03431","headline":"早春边城怀归 · 崔湜","name":"早春边城怀归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大漠羽书飞，长城未解围。\n山川凌玉嶂，旌节下金微。\n路向南庭远，书因北鴈稀。\n乡关摇别思，风雪散戎衣。\n岁尽仍爲客，春还尚未归。\n明年征骑返，歌舞及芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}